{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-palaceCordon-6168": "SOLDIER: 长官，宫殿西翼只许舰队人员进入。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ltOneafter-6169": "OFFICER: 别盯着我，士兵，赶紧走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ltTwoafter-6170": "OFFICER: 字写清楚，没人替你重抄笔记。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-mtgCordon-6171": "SOLDIER: 是，长官。这里就是会议室。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-pCaptive1-6172": "WOMAN: 别管我们，快跑。我们还得给孩子喂奶，他们不会伤害我们的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-pCaptiveDaughter-6173": "DAUGHTER: 他们说，要专门给露易丝生一堆火。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-pCaptive2-6174": "WOMAN: 他们会为了这件事，惩罚我们所有人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-pCaptive4-6175": "WOMAN: 我也想走，可这把老骨头撑不住。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-pCaptiveSon1-6176": "BOY: 长大以后，要是长得够壮，他们也许会让我当战士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-pCaptive5-6177": "WOMAN: 就算回到城里，我也不知道还能不能过得惯……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-pCaptive3-6178": "WOMAN: 我不能丢下女儿……她走不过这片雪地。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-pCaptiveDaughter2-6179": "GIRL: 暴风雪还要下几天？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9teaLady-6180": "WOMAN: 说是将军随时会到……这话都说了两个小时了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-reservedSoldier-6181": "SOLDIER: 抱歉，长官。这里留给魏德林将军。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9breakSoldier-6182": "SOLDIER: 长官，我的岗位就在这儿，长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-plannerA-6183": "OFFICER: 总理坚持要把两个师留在后方，继续清洗斯特拉尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-plannerA-6184": "OFFICER: 可前线的防线上，还到处都是缺口……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-plannerB-6185": "OFFICER: 舰队现在过不了卢斯基亚平原，倒是腾出了一点运力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-plannerClerkTalk-6186": "WOMAN: 这星期，伤亡数字已经往下改过三回了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-palaceStr-6187": "找到力量宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-palaceLuk-6188": "找到生命宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-libResearch-6189": "MAN: 别用那种眼神看我，上一场战争我也上过战场，只是现在年纪大了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-libResearch-6190": "MAN: 抱歉……我一说到这个就忍不住替自己辩解，现在我也就是个图书管理员。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-libSoldier-6191": "SOLDIER: 那些该死的雷津人，居然把自己的人口普查资料全毁了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-libSoldier-6192": "SOLDIER: 害得我们现在还得翻找旧档案，才能算出清洗要花多长时间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-palaceFlirtGirl-6193": "WOMAN: 什么时候去前线？我想找个挣过勋章的男人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-palaceFlirtSoldier-6194": "SOLDIER: 我上过前线，他们把我调回来，是因为我真有脑子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-chCordon-6195": "SOLDIER: 长官，只有获准人员才能上二楼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-extMeeting-6196": "OFFICER: 之前为了运走那些被驱逐的人，光是在火车时刻表里挤出空当，就够让人头疼的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-extMeeting-6197": "OFFICER: 不过，舰队现在停止向东推进了，斯特拉尔的清洗也就快多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-soldierSec-6198": "SOLDIER: 长官，上头催着我把这些时刻表赶出来，我已经忙得喘不过气了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-poolsecA-6199": "WOMAN: 最好快进去，会议就要开始了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-frumpyCookTalk-6200": "WOMAN: 总理亲自来都没用！到了饭点才开饭！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-frumpyCookTalk-6201": "WOMAN: 我不管宫里有没有恐怖分子！定好的时间不是摆设！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-palWaitress-6202": "WOMAN: 军官可以叫人送餐，不过得提前点餐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-diningSoldier1-6203": "SOLDIER: 克纳普也死了？怎么没人告诉我？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-diningSoldier2-6204": "SOLDIER: 外面就是绞肉机……他们根本没报真实伤亡。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-diningSoldier3-6205": "SOLDIER: 我先在这里干着这份差事，等医生批准，就回前线去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-diningSoldier3-6206": "SOLDIER: 我满脑子想的都是队里的战友，不知道他们在前线正遭着什么罪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-libLady-6207": "WOMAN: 唉，午饭时想找点书看，结果全是旧参考书！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-boxSoldier1-6208": "SOLDIER: 抱歉，长官。赶时间的话，可能得绕一下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-boxSoldier2-6209": "SOLDIER: 长官，等新推车送来，我们马上就让路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-poolSec2-6210": "WOMAN: 在这儿是容易认识男人，可又没时间跟他们出去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-poolSec1-6211": "WOMAN: 不是替将军来办事的，就别浪费我时间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-poolSec3-6212": "WOMAN: 为信件来的话，就得等着，少尉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-poolOfficer-6213": "OFFICER: 相信我，少尉，你可不想耽误信件递送。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-nothingOutThere-6214": "ALEXANDRA: （在这个世界，外头也没有我的去处。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-pal2fMover1-6215": "SOLDIER: 抱歉，长官，这里总是在调整，您可以从总参谋部的办公室绕过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-camilleTalk-6216": "CAMILLE: 他们以前对付过拥有你这种力量的人，你还是担心自己吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-zikaronCampfire-6217": "ZIKARON: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-nikoCampfire-6218": "NIKOLAI: 做点吃的，我保证，绝对不是野战口粮。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-nikoCampfire-6219": "NIKOLAI: 哇，带了什么来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-nikoCampfire-6220": "NIKOLAI: 你知道吗，我爸以前开面包店——现在也还开着！我从小可没少起大早。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-nikoCampfire-6221": "NIKOLAI: 说起来，我当初参军，差不多就是为了能睡个懒觉，结果呢？你也看到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-cordeliaCampfire-6222": "CORDELIA: 回到莱奥尼亚，这场危机就能得到妥善处理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-cordeliaCampfire-6223": "CORDELIA: 有什么需要？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-cordeliaCampfire-6224": "CORDELIA: 听说你的土系魔法很出色？正好，有不少问题想请教你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-cordeliaCampfire-6225": "CORDELIA: 我国保存着一些世界分裂前的典籍，里面记载了大量如今已无法使用的土系法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-cordeliaCampfire-6226": "CORDELIA: 其中有些细节颇为晦涩，想必你能帮忙解读。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-jeromeCampfire-6227": "JEROME: 什么东西这么香？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-jeromeCampfire-6228": "BEN: 是啊，我刚出去找了些食材，等做好了你就知道了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-jeromeCampfire-6229": "JEROME: 我小时候常去祖父的农场过夏天，有时也会出去找吃的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-jeromeCampfire-6230": "JEROME: 没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-jeromeCampfire-6231": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，呃，没事……对不起，打扰了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-agataCampfire-6232": "AGATA: 又找到那种蘑菇了？你昨晚做的那道菜真好吃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-agataCampfire-6233": "BEN: 哦，雅赫尼炖菜？可惜韭葱全用完了，真不想这样啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-agataCampfire-6234": "AGATA: 还好吗？有没有再遇到那些不寻常的……来访？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-junaCampfire-6235": "JUNA: 那些野蛮人不追了？那就好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-junaCampfire-6236": "JUNA: 也许我没资格说，可那帮人真够臭的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-junaCampfire-6237": "JUNA: 给我干草和嫩芽就好，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-junaCampfire-6238": "JUNA: 怎么了，小姑娘？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-benCampfire-6239": "BEN: 哦，是啊，我一有机会，就不干早餐班了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-benCampfire-6240": "BEN: 从午夜到早上九点，准没好事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-womanPalace1-6241": "WOMAN: 总理出什么事了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-womanPalace2-6242": "WOMAN: 就这么走了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-womanPalace3-6243": "WOMAN: 长官……要去叫人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-womanPalace4-6244": "WOMAN: 听见了动静……可不敢进去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-manPalace1-6245": "MAN: 您要去叫守卫吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-oldmanPalace1-6246": "OLD MAN: 他不会又大发雷霆了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9book0-6247": "书架上塞满了同一本书：《第一卷——清算》。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9book1-6248": "《作为意志和表象的世界》。书很旧，却似乎几乎没被翻开过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9book2-6249": "一本名为《权杖与铁锤》的平装书。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9book3-6250": "《人类史，第一卷》",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9book4-6251": "《报刊与统制的王国》",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9book5-6252": "《种族卫生理论》",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9book6-6253": "《给所有人，又不给任何人的书》。这本似乎也很少有人读。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9book7-6254": "一本讨论“不配生存的生命”的小册子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9book8-6255": "《种族法条目表》",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9npcs.yarn-ch9book9-6256": "若干期《进攻》。",
  "line:0b8f3f1": "AGATA: 要找书的话，应该就是这里。",
  "line:01d6fcd": "ALEXANDRA: 可怎么知道是哪本？",
  "line:0538cf6": "AGATA: 那就先去打个招呼吧，这里的人……能听懂我说话，对吧？",
  "line:0cbd38b": "ALEXANDRA: 他们说的就是我的语言，而您的方言我也一直听得懂。",
  "line:0ce57bd": "BEN: 这些书，送出旧味道，还有很多头疼。",
  "line:01d712a": "JUNA: 不过，这位可就……",
  "line:058c503": "AGATA: 信不信由你，他的杰兰德语学得很快，才开始说几个星期。",
  "line:015592f": "AGATA: 可这里的人能不能听懂，就不知道了。",
  "line:0959807": "ALEXANDRA: （希望听不懂。）",
  "line:03fde28": "JUNA: （这可是你说的，不是我。）",
  "line:084cf05": "BEN: 我站这里，活着，也听见了。",
  "line:06d7743": "AGATA: 走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3380": "Title: 好……冷",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3381": "Description: 亚历珊德拉独自来到陌生的地方，寻找答案。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3382": "Title: 回家的路？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3383": "Description: 找到回家的办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3384": "Title: 深入虎穴",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3385": "Description: 借助齐卡隆的伪装，寻找暖和衣服。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3386": "Title: 发封电报不就行了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3387": "Description: 找到会议室。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3388": "Title: 这种天气也要出门？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3389": "Description: 继续在亚历珊德拉的世界寻找御寒衣物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3390": "Title: 挣脱束缚",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3391": "Description: 帮助露易丝逃离野蛮人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3392": "Title: 冰天雪地",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3393": "Description: 别被刺骨寒风冻得昏过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3394": "Title: 你怎么会在这里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3395": "Description: 找到卡米耶的房间，看看有没有用得上的东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3396": "Title: 吓出一条路",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3397": "Description: 制造危机，让亚历珊德拉回到自己的世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3398": "Title: 总要救出那个女孩",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3399": "Description: 查明露易丝出了什么事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3400": "Title: 献祭仪式",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3401": "Description: 在野蛮人伤害露易丝之前，阻止他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3402": "Title: 反抗强权",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3403": "Description: 救出亚历珊德拉的同伴，逃离宫殿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3404": "Title: 不屈",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3405": "Description: 找到逃离皇宫的道路！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/coldMinigame.yarn-coldZone_updateHint-7078": "温度：{0}。按 \\[party\\] 取暖"
}
